# 🌙 Moon Dev Trading Bot Environment Variables
# ⚠️ NEVER COMMIT THE ACTUAL .env FILE! THIS IS JUST A TEMPLATE!
# 🔒 Keep your API keys and secrets safe!!

# Trading APIs
